Substrate and AX Firsthand

An independent teaching companion, not an official Agent Substrate or AX release.

This repository builds but does not vendor:
- Agent Substrate, https://github.com/agent-substrate/substrate
- AX, https://github.com/google/ax

Those projects are copyright Google LLC and their contributors and are licensed
under Apache License 2.0. Their original source headers and license files remain
in the source checkouts created during setup. Exact revisions are recorded in
versions.env. compat/ax-substrate.patch records local modifications to AX.

The Kubernetes teaching deployment is adapted from the upstream AX deployment
and the Substrate local certificate/snapshot configuration. The new counter
application and walkthrough are teaching fixtures, not upstream components.

Container base images and Redis are third-party dependencies with their own
licenses. They are downloaded during setup, not distributed as source in this
repository. Review their licenses before redistributing images.
